# WebApp

UI + HTTP host only. No handlers, repos, `AppDbContext`, or entities.

```text
Components/     Blazor pages and shared UI
Endpoints/      *Endpoints.cs — thin IMediator + HTTP
Models/           AuthConstants, SettingsSection (UI/routing only)
Utilities/        CurrentUser, auth cookies, ChatHelpers, form validation
Startup.cs        AddInfrastructure + AddApplication
```

Call Application via `IMediator.SendAsync(new …Request(...))` — not repositories.

## Models (`WebApp/Models/`)

| File | Types |
|------|-------|
| `Constants.cs` | `AuthConstants` |
| `Enums.cs` | `SettingsSection` |

Do **not** put slice DTOs, entities, or use-case types here.

