## Blazor (`Components/`)

C# Features = entity/operation; Blazor `@code` = **user action / UI concern**.

### Directive order

`@page` → `@layout` → `@rendermode` → `@inherits` → `@implements` → `@attribute` → `@using` (not in `_Imports`) → `@inject`

Do not repeat `_Imports.razor` usings.

### Inheritance

| Kind | Base |
|------|------|
| Pages, interactive shared | `BaseComponent` |
| Layout roots | `LayoutComponentBase` |

`BaseComponent`: `Mediator`, `NavigationManager`, `JsRuntime`, `RefreshLayoutAsync()`.

### `@code` layout

1. **Preamble** (no region) — shared state, lifecycle, `[Parameter]`
2. **Feature regions** — `#region # List`, `# Create/Delete`, user-flow names
3. **`#region # Helpers`** — last; shared formatters, JS interop, multi-region helpers

Inner method blocks mirror handlers: `# Validate` → `# Execute` → `# Handle Result`.

### Naming

| Kind | Convention |
|------|------------|
| Injected (base) | PascalCase — `Mediator` |
| Private state | `_camelCase` |
| Event handlers | `OnXxx` / `*Async` |
| CSS | kebab-case |

Underscore prefix is for **Application** constructor injection, not Blazor `[Inject]`.

### File location

- `Pages/{Area}/` — shared URL prefix (`Pages/Auth/Login.razor`)
- `Pages/{Page}/Shared/` — page-local widgets only
- `Components/Shared/` — app-wide chrome (Sidebar, Navbar)
- Do not put page-local widgets in app-wide `Shared/`

### Minimal page

```razor
@page "/your-route"
@inherits BaseComponent
<PageTitle>Title</PageTitle>
<!-- markup -->
@code {
    protected override async Task OnInitializedAsync() { }
    #region # Feature
    #endregion
    #region # Helpers
    #endregion
}
```

## Endpoints

- One file per area: `AuthEndpoints.cs`
- Namespace `WebApp.Endpoints`
- Routes under `/api/...` only
- Thin: validate antiforgery → `mediator.SendAsync` → HTTP result

