## Design system

Unified UI: tokens + `ui-*` in `wwwroot/app.css`, dark/light via `[data-theme]`. **Do not** add a component library or one-off button/card styles.

| Doc / rule | Purpose |
|------------|---------|
| [`docs/design-system.md`](../docs/design-system.md) | Full tokens, components, shell, checklist |
| [`.cursor/rules/design-system.mdc`](design-system.mdc) | Agent checklist when editing WebApp UI |

**Quick rules:** use `app-page` + `ui-group` / `ui-btn` / `ui-segmented` / `ui-dropdown-*`; elevation `--app-elev-1|2|3`; glass blur tiers; focus `--app-focus-ring-shadow`; page CSS in `*.razor.css`, shared patterns in `app.css`.
